# Phase 0 requires no environment variables.
#
# The application must run and build with this file absent.
# Copy to `.env.local` only when a value is actually needed.
#
# Public values are inlined into the browser bundle. Never prefix a secret
# with NEXT_PUBLIC_. Server-only secrets belong in a server-only module and
# are intentionally not defined in Phase 0.

# Optional: canonical origin used for absolute metadata URLs.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
